\f0\b\fs36 \cf2 What this is\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs24 \cf2 Done is a macOS whiteboard/moodboard app for laying out creative project ideas on an infinite canvas \'97 inspired by Milanote, built for a video production workflow. Local-first, no subscription, no clutter.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa298\partightenfactor0

