\f0\b\fs36 \cf2 Why this exists\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs24 \cf2 Milanote is subscription-based. ClickUp was tried as an alternative but its UI feels busy/cluttered compared to Milanote's polish. Done aims for Milanote's simplicity without the subscription, owned locally, with iCloud sync as a later addition for iPhone pairing.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa298\partightenfactor0

